# This page documents GRANT/REVOKE for both SECRET and FUNCTION targets
# together, since the SQL grammar shares one statement for both. Secrets
# shipped already -- its GRANT/REVOKE syntax is documented live at
# sql/ddl/secret.mdx#grant -- but this page stays gated until Functions
# ships too, since un-gating it now would publish the FUNCTION target and
# the CREATE FUNCTION privilege early. At release, remove this entry, fold
# sql/ddl/secret.mdx#grant's content into this page (or cross-link the two),
# add this page to the navigation in docs.json, and give it `availability`
# frontmatter like the rest of the SQL reference. Also see the "Draft for
# the Functions release" blocks in governance/privileges.mdx.
sql/ddl/grant.mdx
